{"duration_api_ms":260016,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"f2cac866-c237-4bc7-8e6f-245b0d87f99a","total_cost_usd":0.8349398000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":70,"cache_creation_input_tokens":52806,"cache_read_input_tokens":2061069,"output_tokens":20125,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":7704},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":52806,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2427,"cache_read_input_tokens":68603,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1227},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10017,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010112,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":70,"outputTokens":20125,"cacheReadInputTokens":2061069,"cacheCreationInputTokens":52806,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8248278000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":7704,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":46,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Published node2's port-8080 HTTP service through node1's management address on TCP/80, keeping the service on the private link, and completed the mandatory sequential restart/recovery proof on all three nodes.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Surveyed topology: node1 (OpenWrt) has br-lan/eth0 as the shared management network (10.100.165.0/24) with node2 and node3, plus an unused eth1; node2 (CentOS) has enp1s0 on the management network and enp8s0 unconfigured (the private link to node1's eth1); node3 has only the management NIC.\",\"Brought up the private link: static 192.168.50.1/24 on node1 eth1 (new UCI interface 'priv') and 192.168.50.2/24 on node2 enp8s0 via nmcli; verified reachability with ping.\",\"Deployed a demo HTTP service on node2 as a systemd unit (demo-http.service, python3 http.server) bound explicitly to 192.168.50.2:8080 only, and opened 8080/tcp in firewalld.\",\"On node1: created firewall zone 'priv' (network=priv, masq=1) so DNAT'd flows get source-NATed to node1's private IP, avoiding asymmetric routing since node2 and node3 share the management subnet; added a lan-to-priv forwarding rule and a redirect (DNAT) rule mapping lan:80 to 192.168.50.2:8080; committed UCI and reloaded firewall.\",\"Verified end-to-end: node3 curl to http://10.100.165.10:80/ returns the node2 service response (HTTP 200); direct node3 access to node2's management IP:8080 and to the private IP:8080 both fail, confirming the service stays private and reachable only via node1's publish path.\",\"Captured boot_id and health baseline on all 3 nodes, then restarted node1, node2, and node3 sequentially (one at a time) with each OS's native reboot, polled exec availability until each returned, confirmed a changed boot_id on each, and re-verified private-link config, service health, and the full node3-to-node1:80-to-node2:8080 path after every single restart before moving to the next node.\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Baseline topology and service state before changes\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-ae361144a60f4de7\",\"cmd-0e60eb67e7a14845\",\"cmd-aae3740050f249b1\",\"cmd-d9cf45671bc74014\",\"cmd-7a7eecb57fca4e74\",\"cmd-b3ab507063394820\",\"cmd-7a8f5bc5dd564ddd\",\"cmd-3a19de5b82864206\",\"cmd-ec2466a4a51844f1\"],\"summary\":\"ip/uci/ss output established node1 eth1 and node2 enp8s0 as the unconfigured private link, and that no HTTP service yet existed on node2 (port 8080 not listening).\"},{\"requirement\":\"Private network established between node1 and node2 (eth1<->enp8s0), excluding node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f653c17a488e4123\",\"cmd-7b25255c2deb432b\",\"cmd-7908bf543b6044b6\"],\"summary\":\"Static IPs 192.168.50.1/2 assigned on node1 eth1 / node2 enp8s0; ping confirms L2/L3 reachability on the private link.\"},{\"requirement\":\"HTTP service on node2 port 8080, private-network only\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f8b0fe3c8b394463\",\"cmd-4b53a2b9622e42e1\",\"cmd-80a7f9f1cd674906\"],\"summary\":\"systemd service demo-http.service listens only on 192.168.50.2:8080 (not 0.0.0.0); node1 fetch over the private link succeeds.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Service published via node1 management IP on TCP 80, reachable from node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7ec2ae65c04c4cfa\",\"cmd-2d4e797518244467\",\"cmd-86cb7f2e4ea84b8f\"],\"summary\":\"UCI firewall zone/forwarding/DNAT redirect committed on node1; node3 curl to http://10.100.165.10:80/ returns the node2 service body with HTTP 200; nft ruleset shows the DNAT rule with a packet hit.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Service stays on the private network (not directly exposed to node3)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b1f4655d4dc94046\"],\"summary\":\"node3 direct curl to node2's management IP:8080 and to the private IP:8080 both fail (000/refused), proving the service is unreachable except through node1's publish path.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c7747968f93b41b2\",\"cmd-b8881a8d3daf49ed\",\"cmd-9c6d2012fb3b40b9\",\"cmd-91ef66b83c714a46\",\"cmd-73ecb5771d224ba1\",\"cmd-9a4828f9c2da4960\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id e7fce50c captured; reboot acked and returned before disconnect; subsequent probe timed out then succeeded; new boot_id df8dec85 confirmed; UCI config, firewall redirect, and full node3->node1->node2 path verified healthy post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node2 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fc42144435aa44c3\",\"cmd-f948586a15c94357\",\"cmd-9138a0ac85cd4f02\",\"cmd-5435759b2e404f9c\",\"cmd-4640f3798d424cfb\",\"cmd-18757ae5eb55468d\",\"cmd-7c3ecc88caeb4509\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 2c237d4f captured; systemctl reboot acked; probes timed out/reset then succeeded; new boot_id 02d267b6 confirmed; private IP, demo-http.service, firewalld port, and full publish path verified healthy post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node3 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5200801bb59b4c16\",\"cmd-f3769b325e64486a\",\"cmd-63700af5e4574290\",\"cmd-49e4488514be47ec\",\"cmd-c9f038fdca10492d\",\"cmd-47a35db7a86e4745\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 5b620f5a captured; systemctl reboot acked; probes timed out/reset then succeeded; new boot_id ee9fa2d1 confirmed; post-restart node3 successfully re-fetched the service via node1:80 while direct access to node2 remained blocked.\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Published node2's port-8080 HTTP service through node1's management address on TCP/80, keeping the service on the private link, and completed the mandatory sequential restart/recovery proof on all three nodes.","actions_performed":["Surveyed topology: node1 (OpenWrt) has br-lan/eth0 as the shared management network (10.100.165.0/24) with node2 and node3, plus an unused eth1; node2 (CentOS) has enp1s0 on the management network and enp8s0 unconfigured (the private link to node1's eth1); node3 has only the management NIC.","Brought up the private link: static 192.168.50.1/24 on 